      "body": "<!-- greptile_summary -->\n\n<h2><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/api/retrigger?id=82586177\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/RetriggerDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"Retrigger\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/Retrigger.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a><a href=\"https://app.greptile.com/nvidia-public-github/github/NVIDIA/transformerengine/-/pull/3701\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptileDark.svg?v=2\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\"><img alt=\"View in Greptile\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/ViewInGreptile.svg?v=2\" align=\"right\"></picture></a>Confidence Score: 5/5</h2>\n\n**[Medium impact]** The PR appears safe to merge; no actionable issue was found.\n\n<h3>Summary</h3>\n\n`GroupedTensor` now supports shape-preserving views used by autograd and forwards CUDA stream tracking to its backing buffers.\n- Identity autograd operations keep same-shape `GroupedTensor` views.\n- `GroupedTensor.record_stream` tracks its CUDA backing tensors.\n\n<!-- greptile_confidence_score:5 -->\n\n<sub>Reviews (1) · Last reviewed commit: [\"Support GroupedTensor autograd views and...\"](https://github.com/nvidia/transformerengine/commit/00ee774c87ba07f14697f270e910868fade90235) · [Reviewed by Greptile](https://www.greptile.com/?utm_source=greptile_review&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=review_public&utm_content=nvidia/transformerengine)</sub>",
